==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|хоро́шій||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|хорошь}} (13th century), from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*xoroščьnъ}}. Cognate with {{cog|uk|хоро́ший}}, {{cog|be|харо́шы}}. Further etymology unclear; probably originally abbreviated from the -шь form of {{m|ru|хоро́брый}} from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*xorbrъ||brave}}, hence cognate with {{m|ru|хра́брый||brave}}, a borrowing from {{cog|cu|храбръ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|хоро́ший}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-{{PAGENAME}}.ogg|Audio}}
* {{hyphenation|ru|хо|ро́|ший}}

